<title>UK: Hyundai sets $100 mln convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Hyundai sets $100 mln convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Union Bank of Switzerland, Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYUNDAI ENGINEERING &amp; CONSTRUCTION, SEOUL</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     0.125     MATURITY    31.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE  CONVERTIBLE    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S 15.JUL.97</p>
<p>CONVERSION PRICE  26,100 WON</p>
<p>CONVERSION PERIOD 18.AUG.97-30.NOV.04</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A PUT ON 15.JUL.02</p>
<p>		6.2382 PCT YIELD TO PUT.</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
